Error [E0204]: `xs` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> whole_place_alias_blocks_overlapping_write_argument.jet:9:15
    |
  9 |     both(&xs, alias)
    |               ^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&xs`) only once, or copy first with `~xs`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
